/* The add-on's identity, and the reason Archicad will or will not load it.
   Two numbers: the Developer ID issued to this practice by Graphisoft, and a
   Local ID generated per add-on on the Developer Portal's Add-ons tab.
   Archicad validates the pair. It is not a formality and it cannot be guessed:
   an invented Local ID answers "This add-on cannot be validated. Please
   contact the distributor." with nothing in the log to say why.
   Neither number is a secret -- both ship inside every add-on binary. The
   Authorization Key from the same portal page is NOT here and must never be:
   it is what generates Local IDs, and it belongs in a password manager. */
'MDID' 32500 "Add-On Identifier" {
	963603759
	1001
}
